`timescale 1ns/1ps
// Policy3: add the same bounded Value lift to every channel; no chroma amplification.
// Policy2: common gain 1+(3*step/16)*(1-V/255)^3, 0..16; black/white fixed.
// Nominal near-black gain 1..4; monotone mapping, no added pixel latency.
// Legacy table retained; enhanced table generated by audit_review10/implement_gamma.py.
// Enhanced power exponent 0.60..1.40 / 0.05, Q12 gain 0.25..2, highlight shoulder above V=192.
// Input sampled at edge n appears at output after edge n+2 (3 register stages).
